# Active and Collaborative Learning in an Introductory Electrical and Computer Engineering Course

**Authors:** Kotru, Sushma, Burkett, Susan L., Jackson, David Jeff

## Abstract
Active and collaborative learning instruments were introduced into an introductory electrical and computer engineering course. These instruments were designed to assess specific learning objectives and program outcomes. Results show that students developed an understanding comparable to that of more advanced students assessed later in the curriculum. (Contains 3 tables.)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ942474

